Fair Use Notice

This repository may contain brief audio clips originating from Brawl Stars
and publicly accessible through the Brawl Stars Wiki.

These audio clips are used solely as notification sounds within PeonPing and
are not presented, distributed, or used as substitutes for the original game
or its audio content.

The use of these clips is intended to be limited in nature and transformative,
repurposing short excerpts as software notification sounds in a context
different from their original use in the game.

